ial position within the <span class=\"highlight\">escape time</span>, they will be <span class=\"highlight\">damaged</span> and <span class=\"highlight\">immobilized</span>.","descriptionRu":"Дозорный проклинает вражеского героя. Если тот остаётся на месте, не воспользовавшись <span class=\"highlight\">временем для побега</span>, он <span class=\"highlight\">получает урон</span> и <span class=\"highlight\">обездвиживается</span>.","abilityType":"signature"},{"id":"2751689917","name":"Willpower","nameRu":"Сила воли","image":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/abilities/warden/warden_high_alert.png","className":"ability_warden_high_alert","description":"Gain a <span class=\"highlight\">Barrier</span> and <span class=\"highlight\">bonus move speed</span>.","descriptionRu":"Дозорный получает <span class=\"highlight\">барьер</span> и <span class=\"highlight\">повышенную скорость передвижения</span>.","abilityType":"signature"},{"id":"2656490109","name":"Alchemical Flask","nameRu":"Алхимическая колба","image":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/abilities/warden/warden_crowd_control.png","className":"ability_warden_crowd_control","description":"Throw a flask that <span class=\"highlight\">damages</span> and reduces the <span class=\"highlight\">weapon damage and move speed</span> of enemies it hits.","descriptionRu":"Дозорный бросает колбу, которая <span class=\"highlight\">наносит врагам урон</span>, <span class=\"highlight\">замедляет их передвижение и уменьшает урон от их оружия</span>.","abilityType":"signature"},{"id":"2702908623","name":"Last Stand","nameRu":"Последний бой","image":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/abilities/warden/warden_riot_protocol.png","className":"ability_warden_riot_protocol","description":"After charging for 2s, <span class=\"highlight\">release pulses that damage enemies and heal you</span> based on the damage done. <br>While channeling Last Stand you have greatly increased <span class=\"highlight\">bullet and spirit resist</span>.<br><br><span class=\"small_diminish\">Immune to fear while Last Stand is active.</span>","descriptionRu":"После подготовки в 2 сек. Дозорный <span class=\"highlight\">выпускает импульсы, которые наносят урон врагам и лечат его</span> пропорционально нанесённому урону. <br>Во время использования этого умения ваша <span class=\"highlight\">сопротивляемость пулям и спиритизму</span> значительно увеличивается.<br><br><span class=\"small_diminish\">Пока умение активно, Дозорный невосприимчив к страху.</span>","abilityType":"ultimate"},{"id":"2573821048","name":"Knocked off Zipline","nameRu":"Падение с зиплайна","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_zip_line","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"1466127517","name":"Jump","nameRu":"Прыжок","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_jump","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"2335418656","name":"Slide","nameRu":"Скольжение","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_slide","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"875395762","name":"citadel_ability_zipline_boost","image":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/upgrades/mods_utility/zipline_mastery.png","className":"citadel_ability_zipline_boost","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"4109126631","name":"Mantle","nameRu":"Преодоление препятствия","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_mantle","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"4261702459","name":"citadel_ability_climb_rope","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_climb_rope","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"1443159618","name":"","image":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/icons/hud/icons/icon_speed.svg","className":"citadel_ability_sprint","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"2207638101","name":"Dash","nameRu":"Рывок","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_dash","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"664285540","name":"Parry","nameRu"